      "value": "Advanced GUI shop sell template:\n\nThis waits until you have enough of one item, opens a sell command, clicks the GUI item, closes, then loops.\nIt is server-specific. Edit before running.\n\nEdit these components:\nEDIT Sell Item Count: item ID and amount.\nEDIT Sell Command: command that opens your server sell GUI.\nEDIT GUI Click: slot or item in the sell GUI.\nEDIT Wait After Sell: delay before checking again.\n\nSafe test: change Sell Command to /help and disconnect GUI Click before trying on a server.",
